{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51976","headline":"西江月 · 吕岩","name":"西江月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落日数声啼鸟，香风满路吹花。\n道人邀我煮新茶，荡涤胸中潇洒。\n世事不堪回音，梦魂犹遶天涯。\n凤停桥畔即吾家，管甚月明今夜。\n（《湖海新闻夷坚续志後集》一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51976.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51976","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}